  "analysis": [
    {
      "label": "Context",
      "text": "Level at 2–2 in stoppage time, and with Manchester United winning at Sunderland, City had to score to win the league on goal difference. QPR, down to ten men, were defending deep in numbers."
    },
    {
      "label": "Build-up",
      "text": "De Jong's carry through midfield gave City a rare chance to attack before QPR could settle. Agüero moved the ball into Balotelli on the edge of the box, then kept running for the return."
    },
    {
      "label": "Key moment",
      "text": "Balotelli, going to ground under pressure, poked the ball back into Agüero's stride. The one-two turned a crowded edge of the box into a direct run at goal."
    },
    {
      "label": "The finish",
      "text": "Agüero rode Taiwo's challenge and kept balance on the right of the box. The shot was driven in at the near post, beating Kenny before QPR could close again."
    }
  ],
